### Forms for the Filing Period June 3-12, 2026

 Declaration of Candidacy forms will be available after May 1, 2026. Forms will only be accepted in person or by mail during the filing period, June 3-11, 2026. On the last day of the filing period, June 12, 2026, filings can only be made in person by the candidate. Anyone running for Governor, US Senator, Representative in Congress, Executive Councilor, State Senator, State Representative, Delegate to the Republican State Convention or County Office can obtain a declaration of candidacy from this office in person or request that one be mailed to you. Anyone filing for State Representative or Delegate to the Republican State Convention can also obtain a declaration of candidacy from their town/city clerk towards the middle of May. Those filing as third party candidates, will need a declaration of intent from the Secretary of State's office and will need the nomination papers posted below: 

*   [Nomination Paper / Individual .pdf![Image 22: PDF document](https://www.sos.nh.gov/sites/g/files/ehbemt561/files/styles/inline_icon/public/2019-12/icon-pdf.png?h=e77b622d&itok=6zfkoASg)](https://mm.nh.gov/files/uploads/sos/docs/nomination-paper-individual-2026.pdf)
*   [Nomination Paper / Multi Candidates .pdf![Image 23: PDF document](https://www.sos.nh.gov/sites/g/files/ehbemt561/files/styles/inline_icon/public/2019-12/icon-pdf.png?h=e77b622d&itok=6zfkoASg)](https://mm.nh.gov/files/uploads/sos/docs/nomination-paper-multi-2026.pdf)
*   [Nomination Paper / Political Organization .pdf![Image 24: PDF document](https://www.sos.nh.gov/sites/g/files/ehbemt561/files/styles/inline_icon/public/2019-12/icon-pdf.png?h=e77b622d&itok=6zfkoASg)](https://mm.nh.gov/files/uploads/sos/docs/nomination-paper-political-organization-2026.pdf)

